<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34455" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pellūcĭdus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">perl-</span></b> ), a, um,
			adj.
		perluceo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>transparent</i>, <i>pellucid.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">membrana,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. N. D. 2, 57, 142</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">deos induxit Epicurus perlucidos et
					perflabiles,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Div. 2, 17, 40</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fons,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					H. 15, 157</span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arcanique fides prodiga perlucidior vitro,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					C. 1, 18, 16</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">perlucidus, crenidatus, armillatus,</span>”
				<i>in a transparent garment</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Const. Sap. 18</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pellucidus ostro,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart. 12, 38, 3</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>very bright</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">illustris et perlucida stella,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Div. 1, 57, 130</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
